  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reconstruction of permanent housing in earthquake affected ares of Jacmel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This reconstruction project is in response to the earthquake that struck Haiti on the 12th January 20120. Throughout the life cycle of this project 20 families will have their houses re-built after being made homeless from the damage and destruction caused by the earthquake.</narrative>
  </description>
